From edd at debian.org  Tue Nov 17 15:39:51 2020
From: edd at debian.org (Dirk Eddelbuettel)
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2020 09:39:51 -0600
Subject: Re: Packaging Hybrid R/Python Software
